{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t委員會的報告提出了120項建議，政府會以報告為基礎進行全面改革，政府將會成立由政務司司長陳國基領導的督導委員會，推展建議落實工作，並會建立跨部門聯合中央數據系統，加強負責樓宇安全等不同部門的協調及資訊分享。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:52.210335+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:57:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T21:18:33.691478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:36.890936+00:00","content_hash":"eb5166210ede762a190e084bf2f74917500cc645e6b78727ccd4d9f5d0a96a7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}